          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 28:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nĩvo ĩndĩ mwathani Yelemia wamwĩie mwathani Aanania, Ĩthukĩĩsye yu, Aanania: Yeova ndaakũtũma we; ĩndĩ naku wĩĩkĩĩthya andũ aa ũvũngũ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.28.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.28.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
